"rustyfiles must be open on the other device, with Ferry on. A device you haven’t paired with is listed only while its visibility is Everyone.": "rustyfiles turi būti atidarytas kitame įrenginyje, su įjungtu Ferry. Nesusietas įrenginys rodomas tik tada, kai jo matomumas yra „Visi“.",
"The speed test did not finish.": "Greičio testas nebaigtas.",
